title: OpenAI Platform: Organization usage
agents: openai_platform
catalog: app
license: GPLv2
distribution: checkmk-openai extension
description: Shows provider-reported usage for the configured aggregation window. The headline uses Completions/Responses when active, otherwise an active usage family is shown. Counts are workload data and are not compared with fixed totals. Optional thresholds are disabled by default. Usage documentation: https://help.openai.com/en/articles/10478918-reviewing-api-usage-and-costs.
discovery: One service is created whenever usage data is available.
